"P951447111" "Thank you, {VillainName}. I'll try reading the incantation. If this works, we should know immediately. <br><br>Qual est vandoroth <br><br>Ural san dermoth <br><br>Kasail kasail <br><br>Kal men tanderoth <br><br>I remember, {VillainName}! I remember it all!"
