// Dialog :
"P271623719" "So, the Rikti were using my DNA to create a new generation of aliens? I can only assume my psionic gifts gave them something they lacked. But there's something else I have to tell you, {VillainName}. Something else I've remembered. Rikti: Humans. They share a common ancestry with us:  Some How: Some Way. That's why my DNA could fertilize their embryos, and it's probably the biggest secret left on this earth. There's no way I'm sharing this info with Arachnos. Now that I have my memory back, I recall a lot of nasty things they've done to me. No, {VillainName}, this secret is just for you and me. <br><br>At least I won't share a legacy with the creatures. I'm going to incinerate these embryos you found, {VillainName}. I'd rather die than be father to the Rikti's future!"

